 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:29.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.76,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,therDialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:27.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:27.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:25.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ideDialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:26.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WeDialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:26.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,fightDialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:26.67,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,toDialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:26.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,geDialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:28.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,therDialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Did the Navy win?Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:48.26,Main,,0,0,0,,– They did, didn't they? – It's getting clearer now.Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:52.83,Title,,0,0,250,,Creeping FutureDialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:52.82,Main,,0,0,0,,– The Whitebeard Pirates lost? – Did the Navy really pull through?Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:56.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle that occurred at Marineford...Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,between the Whitebeard Pirates and Navy HQ...Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,lasted longer than expected due to the enemy's tenacity.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,However, the marines who fought for justice...Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:13.46,Main,,0,0,0,,prevailed over the Whitebeard Pirates and their allies.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We are happy to report that the Navy has achieved a total victory. Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,They did it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy is invincible! Here's to our heroes!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to transfer to HQ someday!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The war is over!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:47.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:53.51,Main,,0,0,0,,The legendary pirate Whitebeard was defeated!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:04:01.85,Main,,0,0,0,,– The war is over, right? – Yes! You're safe now!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.58,Main,,0,0,0,,– This is so great! – They did it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.99,Main,,0,0,0,,We're safe!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:09.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray for the Navy! Hooray for the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And for victory and justice and peace! Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:31.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Several ships lurk in the waters near the battlefield, Marineford.Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:34.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Those who would shoulder the coming era...Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:38.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,had to witness this historical turning point.Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:42.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Surveying the dust settling over Marineford—Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:45.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,proof of the order that reigns in the Great Pirate Era—Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:50.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,they grasp the seething unrest of the times.Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:51.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Drake.Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:55.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It's finally over.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy will have to change, too.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before...Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:07.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's territory devolves into a chaotic sea of blood.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard is the key.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He has new followers and Whitebeard's power.Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:19.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be the eye of the storm for a while!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all... his fault!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll track him down soon enough!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go! To the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:39.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Apoo-san?Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy is going to become a rival. Is he really gonna save him?Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Trafalgar Law. He's known for his cruelty.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:56.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't save Straw Hat Luffy without some ulterior motive.Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Strange.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Captain Hawkins?Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I've repeatedly checked the odds of Straw Hat Luffy's survival,Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:11.73,Main,,0,0,0,,but they're never zero.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:17.87,Main,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was scared when the war started,Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,but now the great pirate Whitebeard is dead.Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's really over, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:25.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "over"?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That Blackbeard is quite a guy!  He's emerged as a major power due to this war. Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The New World is ruled by the Four Emperors.Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, Red Hair, Kaido, Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But now one of them is dead,Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.73,Main,,0,0,0,,the world is out of balance and no one can predict the consequences!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of a new era, the likes of which no one has ever seen!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:19.44,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The news of the Navy's victory in the battle of Marineford,Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the biggest conflict since the beginning of the Great Pirate Era,Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.77,Narrator,,0,0,0,,spread throughout the world in the blink of an eye,Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and people everywhere rejoice.Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:31.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,East BlueDialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,– Whitebeard is dead! – Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,– We're safe now! – I'm so glad!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,West Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,West BlueDialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:44.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea will be at peace now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:46.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,South BlueDialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:48.09,Narrator,,0,0,0,,South Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have a bargain sale today!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,So are we!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,– The Navy has won! – I'm so relieved!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:58.36,Narrator,,0,0,0,,North Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:57.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,North BlueDialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.99,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let's drink, everybody! – We have tons of it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:07.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.78,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do tomorrow?Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna play tag!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hide and seek!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.27,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh God, thank you so much! Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:25.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Like most of history, some facts are omitted as the news spreads...Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:30.14,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and just the two words "Navy victory" stand out.Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:35.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The people, in their excitement at the news, failed to notice something.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:44.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at you people! That's hilarious!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard said that the great treasure, One Piece, is real!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:09:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,There is so much more out there! Let's set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:07.26,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A victory for the Navy...Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:13.13,Narrator,,0,0,0,,does not necessarily mean peace.Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:10.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,New World - Foodvalten Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't come any further! Stay away from our town!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.56,Narrator,,0,0,0,,With the loss of Whitebeard as a deterrent,Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:32.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the seas have become a lot more precarious.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I turned all the marines to stone.Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,So how is Luffy doing?Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it bad? He'll recover, won't he?Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you know that we were gonna surface here?Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:54.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I was terrified that the Navy was still chasing us.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:57.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I made Salome follow you underwater.Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:10:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,– I see! – Don't change the subject, you furry beast!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.12,Main,,0,0,0,,– I'm sorry! – What a pushover!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:10.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Captain Trafalgar Law Heart PiratesDialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I did everything I could.Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean, he's okay?Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We were able to stabilize him. However,Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,he took more damage than you'd believe.Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:25.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't guarantee that he'll survive.Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:31.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's talking?Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:37.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy couldn't even stand up back at Impel Down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,– Straw Hat put his life on the line! – We escaped thanks to him!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, we can achieve our dream...Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,of going to the Kamabakka Kingdom!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,From Newkama Land to the heart of newkamadom!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:57.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are they?Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:11:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,They were prisoners in Impel Down. It seems that Luffy befriended them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They stowed away on the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,It's astonishing he pushed himself that hard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how much he wanted to save his brother Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:17.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We all saw how far he pushed himself!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,But his brother died in front of his eyes...Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:25.43,Main,,0,0,0,,in order to protect him.Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:32.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a cruel world! It's no wonder that he broke down!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! Hang in there, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta live! You gotta, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:51.89,Main,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy! I wish I could take his place!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:54.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Poor Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be nice to have the Pirate Empress care about you that much.Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.26,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, are vyou a friend of Straw Hat-boy?Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.81,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't have any obligation to save him at all.Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:12.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I could make up some reason,  if simple kindness concerns you.Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:16.62,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay. Sometimes instinct drives you.Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey, wait! – You can't walk around yet!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,– Don't push yourself like that! – He told you to rest!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:27.07,Main,,0,0,0,,– The wound could open up! – Where are you going?Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Trafalgar Law, from the North Blue, aren't you? Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, should vyou move around in vyour condition?Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved my life!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Get some rest. Moving could kill you.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,My mind can't find rest. It's hopeless!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:13:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What I have just lost was too important to me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I know that Luffy-kun must be going through far worse!Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,At least his survival instincts...Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,forced him to lose consciousness back there!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if he pulls through,Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't stop worrying about the moment he wakes up.Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You, furry beast! Do you have a transponder snail?Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:34.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I mean... yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,– I'm jealous. He's like her servant. – Yeah, for sure.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I can have the Kuja Pirates' ship take this submarine across the Calm Belt.Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:50.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If the government finds out that Luffy's alive, they will come after him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you shelter on the Isle of Women.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:14:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If they still see me as a warlord, Luffy can rest safely!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Here you are!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We've received word from Impel Down!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Magellan all right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:34.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He was badly beaten and is barely alive.Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The medical team is administering intensive care as we speak.Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:43.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a dutiful man; it seems he's taking full responsibility.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They said that if he could move now, he's unstable enough to possibly kill himself.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him do something that stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What is the status of the prison?Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get you up to speed.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:03.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The situation on Level 6 is especially bad. It's literally a disaster.Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.15,Main,,0,0,0,,A disaster?Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:12.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,Impel Down, the Undersea PrisonDialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What's up, fellas?Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You prisoners are doomed to be stuck behind bars forever!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The only thing you can do is wait for death!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:28.34,Main,,0,0,0,,So, how about this?! Why don't you all fight to the death in your cells?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll free the survivors and have them join my crew!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,– Really?! – Get me out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll win a place in your crew!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:55.47,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's how he freed the world's most notorious inmates?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. But only four prisoners were taken.Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:16:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanjuan Wolf, Avalo Pizarro, Vasco Shot, and Catarina Devon.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But there are clearly other prisoners missing from Level 6!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means...Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.49,0:16:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand. Then, there are more escapees!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If even one of the fugitives from Level 6 reaches a country somewhere,Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:34.27,Main,,0,0,0,,the citizens will be in grave danger!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:37.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Check to see how many there were.Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Get their names, and put together a most wanted list now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I...Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The World Government has ruled that this incident...Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,is to be covered up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Any more blunders on our part will cause a loss of confidence in the government.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:05.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:43.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Moria, you're too weak to go on with the title of warlord.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,"Died in the Summit War" has a better ring to it...Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:51.72,Main,,0,0,0,,than "done in by the government".Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose idea was this?! Sengoku's?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:18:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,No, someone even higher up!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:06.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,West BlueDialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,A pirate ship is approaching Lascamp, in the West Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No battleships are available to mount an attack at the nearby naval bases!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:29.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What are the codes for the nearest bases?! Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:32.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The 80th Branch will send backup!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the South Blue checking the location of the site!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought pirates would be...Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,afraid of us after we killed Whitebeard and emerged victorious!Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead of laying low, they're  going wild everywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into them?Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates have landed at Lascamp!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We have lost touch with them! Send backup!Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:00.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I repeat, send backup to Lascamp!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:07.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Load the supplies! Let's head for the Grand Line! Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:16.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,New World - FoodvaltenDialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:15.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Two weeks after the Summit War,Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:19.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,people around the world start seeing its impact.Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:27.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't come any further! Don't come into our town!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You heard the news, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you know that this island is no longer Whitebeard's territory.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,This symbol is meaningless now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Whitebeard is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:11.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up and burn this into your memory!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Starting today, this island belongs to me,Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,the pirate Brownbeard!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:25.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The war ended with the death of Whitebeard and the victory of the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:28.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But contrary to what the Navy expected,Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:32.53,Narrator,,0,0,0,,seas across the globe are showing signs of falling into disarray.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.49,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A little while earlier,Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:39.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Hancock, Jinbe, and the others decided...Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:42.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to harbor the unconscious Luffy on the Isle of Women.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:45.99,Narrator,,0,0,0,,They have rendezvoused with the Kujas' ship.Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:53.78,Main,,0,0,0,,All right then, this is it for my role in supporting Straw Hat-boy.Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:59.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if Vi leave the rest up to you, Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. I can't swim yet anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is stay here until he gets well.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I can help him, though.Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a curious twist of fate to meet vyou.Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I agree.Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We were both locked up in...Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,the greatest prison in the world, Impel Down,Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.81,Main,,0,0,0,,but if it weren't for Luffy-kun,Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:28.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose we would have never met at all.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We both tried really hard to keep up with Straw Hat-boy at Marineford, didn't we?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say goodbye to vyou,Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,but Vi have sweet candies waiting for me to come back to my kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:46.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Please take good care of Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye, Straw Hat! Thank you for letting us out!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,My dream can come true because of you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Say "hi" to him when he wakes up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,– See you again if we have a chance! – Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't die, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:11.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,To the heart of newkamadom and the place we have longed to see!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,To the Kamabakka Kingdom!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to head for the Isle of Women, too.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:26.69,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Two weeks later,Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:30.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Law and others are staying by the coast...Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:33.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to treat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.89,0:22:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.69,0:22:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous! Calm down, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What will happen if we leave him be?Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like I said when we got to this island,Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:23:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,if his wound opens up, he'll die.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.01,0:23:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, now is our chance!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:10.73,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let me go, dammit! – Stay still, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:13.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I said "let me go"!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:17.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Ace?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.55,0:23:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ace!! – Damn! He's out of control!Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:25.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– It's Luffy! – We need to inform the Snake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess! Snake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy woke up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,– Luffy-sama?! – Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. I wanna see him right away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:40.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't, Snake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.23,0:23:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody wants to see him.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:47.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Your orders will mean nothing, if you allow yourself to go and see him.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Men are prohibited on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We're allowing those strange men to stay by the coast;  we cannot make anymore exceptions!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I know, but...Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.89,0:24:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Before that, Big Sis, you need to eat something.Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:08.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, Big Sis! You've barely eaten since you got back!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:11.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Luffy must be very hungry, too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:15.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare a mountain of our best dishes to give him energy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:16.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'd be happy to!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:21.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I will help you! Ladies, let's get to it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:23.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Snake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.47,0:24:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I should just let her do that. She just wants to make some food.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.21,0:24:31.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'm gonna take them to him!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.43,0:24:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're going?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:38.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We agreed that when he gets well, we would welcome Luffy alone.Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for that moment!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.46,0:24:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't! I am an empress! Don't tell me what to do!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.28,0:24:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I said no!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,The traditions of our nation are more important than the whims of our current ruler!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly! You're infected by such a strong virus!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that the dread Pirate Empress has become love sick!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.09,0:25:03.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,However, he must have been like a small ant...Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:06.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,diving into a tempest at Impel Down and the Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:11.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It must have been an act of the gods to let him live and be brought back here.Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.66,0:25:17.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they expect from him.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey, pass me the wrench. – Okay, here you go.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think you can fix the ship?Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.53,0:25:28.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll manage. That aside, where did Straw Hat go?Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.78,0:25:30.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe is gone, too.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.05,0:25:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard that if a man enters the...Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Isle of Women, he'll get turned to stone.Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,But maybe it's worth dying for.Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.73,0:25:47.16,Main,,0,0,0,,According to Aphelandra-chan, not all women were there at the port.Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.16,0:25:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The island full of women that I dreamed of! I wish I could take a look inside!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die, you idiot.Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.22,0:25:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there are female bears.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.31,0:25:58.11,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Isle of Women!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.11,0:25:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:02.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Only humans! There are only humans!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.49,0:26:43.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Where am I?Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.58,0:26:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was all a dream.Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.18,0:27:06.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.51,0:27:13.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be saved.Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.98,0:27:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away! Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.39,0:27:28.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.99,0:27:32.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.14,0:27:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away! Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:24.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If I can't avoid death,Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.22,0:28:30.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but could you look after my brother?Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.45,0:28:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The war is over!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.34,0:28:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-san is...Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.76,0:28:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say it! Don't say anything!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.09,0:28:45.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I already pinched myself hard enough to rip my skin!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.39,0:28:50.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If it were a dream, I would've woken up already!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.22,0:28:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not a dream, is it?Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.45,0:29:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is really dead, isn't he?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:29.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey Grandpa, who's Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.38,0:29:32.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's...Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.85,0:29:36.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,gonna be your big brother!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.99,0:29:42.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I'll see you when you've reached the top of the pirate world!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.86,0:29:45.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Come meet me at the summit!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.02,0:30:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!!